OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warnings issued for
OL,4,Aparts of UK with flash flooding
OL,5,Aexpected
OL,6,
OL,7,FYellow thunderstorm warnings have been
OL,8,Fissued across the UK, with heavy
OL,9,Fshowers expected to lead to flash
OL,10,Fflooding and travel disruption.
OL,12,FThe Met Office warnings will come into
OL,13,Fforce across northern England, Northern
OL,14,FIreland and eastern Scotland later in
OL,15,Fthe day on Wednesday. The warning for
OL,16,Fnorthern England will remain in place
OL,17,Funtil Thursday morning.
OL,19,FThe downpours follow almost two months
OL,20,Fof dry weather, with parts of the
OL,21,Fcountry experiencing their first rain
OL,22,Fin weeks on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
