OL,3,GNEWSAThunderstorm warnings issued for
OL,4,Aparts of UK with flash flooding
OL,5,Aexpected
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople in areas impacted by
OL,8,Fthunderstorms have been told by the Met
OL,9,FOffice to expect that businesses and
OL,10,Fhomes could flood, transport services
OL,11,Fcould be delayed and power cuts are
OL,12,Flikely.
